00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:23.981
FELIPE HOFFA: Yeah?

00:02:23.981 --> 00:02:25.870
GRAHAM POLLEY: I chose data.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:28.480
I wrote 20 lines of code,
